# Cursor Rules for @isthis/agentic

All development practices, TDD rules, and verification commands in this repository adhere strictly to `AGENTS.md` in the project root as the Single Source of Truth (SSOT).

## Guidelines
1. Refer to `AGENTS.md` for all core behavioral contracts and verification commands.
2. Always execute `npm run check` after modifications to confirm test passing.
3. Manage any project-specific domain extensions exclusively in `AGENTS.md`.
